ror thriller. Every day you wake up in a hospital bedroom. You notice anomalies? Take your pills. You think it's safe? Use the call button. But survive long enough, and you must face your interactive nightmares...", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-call-button", "videos": [{"id": 183108, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "wNwmqbWQ0TY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wNwmqbWQ0TY", "title": "The Call Button - First Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wNwmqbWQ0TY/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 185868, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "7vGW7-HfJ7s", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7vGW7-HfJ7s", "title": "Second Trailer - The Call Button", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7vGW7-HfJ7s/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}